content:
Crypto users keep losing funds because wallets show raw transactions they cannot understand. Scams and blind approvals are still common.

IntentShield is an AI agent layer that turns any onchain action into clear intent, simulates outcomes, flags hidden risks, and blocks suspicious approvals in real time. It also builds an onchain safety score for users.

